UID:6a4946b7ed35742f00005a37@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Want to play with electricity? Drop in for a half hour of fun
  with circuitry. Turn on a light\, spin a motor\, activate a speaker\; wor
 k your way through the 100+ circuitry projects as you learn about electric
 ity!\nFor ages 6-12.\nParent/Caregiver must attend.\nDrop in program. Spac
 e is limited.
