UID:6a8399a83b6c71003e598efd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Join an After School
  Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have fun!\nA
 fter School Clubs are offered for children ages 6-12 at select branches. A
 ctivities can include make and take projects\, coding and robotics worksho
 ps and more!\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for particip
 ants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\
 , in part\, by donors.\nAfter School Club: Dash and Dot\nJoin us as we lea
 rn the basics of coding using Dash and Dot robots! Take control as you gui
 de your robot through a series of challenges!\nNo registration required
LOCATION:McGregor Park
