UID:6a7dd8074027d701ebc412f9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Chess Institute of Canada is bringing chess to life at you
 r local library!\nJoin us as we explore the ancient game of chess and the 
 essential life-skills the game imparts. Come and take in a lesson on the g
 reat game or sit down and start playing!\nLearn\, compete\, connect with y
 our community through the game of chess.\nOpen to all ages. Children under
  12 need to be supervised.
